<title>GREECE: Greece plans 15 pct tax on interbank depos -source.</title>
<headline>Greece plans 15 pct tax on interbank depos -source.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece will impose a 15-percent withholding tax on interbank depos, effective January 1, sources at the finance ministry told Reuters.</p>
<p>The decision could not be immediately confirmed, but sources said deputy finance minister George Drys had signed the official decree on Tuesday.</p>
